\newlabel{fig:nextperm}{{6.4}{68}{How \texttt {next\_permutation} finds the next arrangement in lexicographic order: find the pivot, swap it with its successor in the suffix, reverse the suffix. Only the pivot and the suffix change}{figure.caption.95}{}}
